{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for membership access, consultations, and safe aromatherapy guidance.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fcfbf8;
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --accent:#6aa84f;
      --accent-2:#8e44ad;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
      --maxw:1100px;
      --radius:14px;
      --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(17,17,17,0.07);
      --nav-h:72px;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#222;}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:24px auto;padding:20px;}
    header{height:var(--nav-h);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
    nav a:hover{color:#333}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(250,250,250,0.95));padding:36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:30px;line-height:1.08;color:#183028}
    .lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .cta-row{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#58b368);color:white;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px}

    /* pattern svg behind */
    .pattern-wrap{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.14}
    .pattern-wrap svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}

    /* Contact card */
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(20,20,20,0.06)}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    form .row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);background:transparent;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .muted-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    /* sections grid */
    section{margin-top:28px}
    .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:22px;align-items:start}
    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(138,197,88,0.12),rgba(142,68,173,0.08));border-radius:999px;color:#2b3b2a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px}

    /* ritual */
    .ritual{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(252,250,245,0.9));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    .ritual-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    .ritual-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .dot{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}

    /* what to expect */
    .expect ul{margin:12px 0 0 18px}

    /* schedule */
    .schedule-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
    .slot{background:var(--card);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}

    /* pricing */
    .membership{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .price-tag{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1f4e2a}

    /* faq */
    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}
    .q{font-weight:700}
    .a{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}

    footer{margin-top:36px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),rgba(250,250,250,0.95));box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .schedule-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">A</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="/shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Pricing</a>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="/contact.html" style="color:#333;font-weight:600">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
        <div>
          <div class="pill">Membership + gentle rituals</div>
          <h1 id="hero-heading">Reach out to start a calm, safety-first aromatherapy journey</h1>
          <p class="lead">I’m {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, your aromatherapy practitioner. If you’re curious about membership, blends, or a one-on-one consultation, share a few details below and I’ll respond within 48 hours.</p>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <button class="btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <a class="ghost" href="/pricing.html">Membership plans</a>
          </div>

          <div class="muted-note">Prefer phone? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — voicemail is checked daily.</div>
        </div>

        <aside class="card" aria-labelledby="contact-card">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:700" id="contact-card">Contact & Hours</div>
              <div class="small">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — virtual and in-person options</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted)">Membership • Blends • Consult</div>
          </div>

          <form id="contact-form" style="margin-top:14px" onsubmit="handleSubmit(event)">
            <label class="small">Your name</label>
            <input name="name" placeholder="Jane Doe" required>

            <label class="small">Email</label>
            <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>

            <label class="small">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input name="phone" placeholder="(555) 555-5555">

            <label class="small">What are you interested in?</label>
            <select name="interest" required>
              <option value="membership">Membership</option>
              <option value="consult">Consultation</option>
              <option value="blends">Custom blend</option>
              <option value="shop">Shop / product question</option>
            </select>

            <label class="small">Message</label>
            <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell me about timing, sensitivities, pets, or anything that matters."></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px">
              <button class="btn" type="submit">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" class="ghost" onclick="document.getElementById('contact-form').reset()">Clear</button>
            </div>

            <div class="muted-note">By contacting us you consent to receive replies to the email you provide. For privacy details, see our policy.</div>
          </form>

        </aside>

        <div class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- decorative SVG pattern for visual richness -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 300" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#eafaf0"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#f5eafc"/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <g fill="url(#g1)">
              <path d="M0 120 C150 200 350 20 600 80 C850 140 1050 40 1200 100 L1200 300 L0 300 Z" opacity="0.9"/>
            </g>
            <g fill-opacity="0.06" fill="#000">
              <circle cx="80" cy="40" r="40" />
              <circle cx="170" cy="80" r="24" />
              <circle cx="320" cy="30" r="28" />
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="two-col">
        <div>
          <div class="ritual card">
            <div class="pill">A short ritual</div>
            <h3 style="margin:10px 0 0 0">A simple breathing ritual you can do now</h3>
            <p class="small">Rituals are a gentle scaffold — they hold space while you notice scent, breath, and ease. No claims, only mindful practice.</p>
            <div class="ritual-list">
              <div class="ritual-item"><div class="dot">1</div><div><strong>Set intention</strong><div class="small">Take a moment to settle and name why you're aromatizing — clarity helps guide blend choice.</div></div></div>
              <div class="ritual-item"><div class="dot">2</div><div><strong>Gentle inhale</strong><div class="small">Place your blend an arm's length away. Breathe slowly for 4 counts, exhale for 6 counts.</div></div></div>
              <div class="ritual-item"><div class="dot">3</div><div><strong>Observe</strong><div class="small">Notice sensations, any tension, and note if the aroma feels supportive. Discontinue if irritation appears.</div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card expect" style="margin-top:18px">
            <h3>What to expect after you reach out</h3>
            <p class="small">My approach centers safety, clarity, and personalization. Typical next steps:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Friendly reply within 48 hours to schedule a quick intake.</li>
              <li>Discussion of preferences, sensitivities, and any safety considerations.</li>
              <li>Optional membership details and custom blend suggestions (non-medical).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
            <h3>Availability & Scheduling</h3>
            <p class="small">I offer short virtual check-ins and 60–90 minute in-person sessions. Weekday evenings and Saturday mornings are common booking windows.</p>
            <div class="schedule-list" style="margin-top:12px">
              <div class="slot"><strong>Mon–Fri</strong><div class="small">5:00 PM – 8:00 PM</div></div>
              <div class="slot"><strong>Saturday</strong><div class="small">9:00 AM – 1:00 PM</div></div>
              <div class="slot"><strong>Virtual</strong><div class="small">Flexible — weekday mornings</div></div>
              <div class="slot"><strong>New members</strong><div class="small">Orientation included</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="card">
            <h4 style="margin-top:0">Membership snapshot</h4>
            <div class="membership">
              <div>
                <div class="price-tag">$18/mo</div>
                <div class="small">Access to monthly blends, member-only workshops, and a 15% shop discount.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <hr style="margin:14px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)">

            <div style="font-weight:700">Quick contact</div>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:6px">Phone: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>
            <div class="small">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer to book directly? <a href="/book.html">Schedule here</a>.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
            <h4 style="margin-top:0">Preparation</h4>
            <div class="small">Share any skin sensitivities, pregnancy status, or pet presence in your home so we can keep blends safe and thoughtful.</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="card" style="margin-top:28px">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Frequently asked questions (safety-forward)</h3>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="q">How do I dilute essential oils safely?</div>
          <div class="a">Dilution depends on the user and use-case. For adults, typical topical dilutions range from 0.5%–3% for daily wear; consult directly to tailor this. Never apply undiluted essential oils to skin. This is general guidance, not medical advice.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="q">Should I do a patch test?</div>
          <div class="a">Yes. Apply a small diluted amount to a forearm patch and observe for 24–48 hours. If redness, itching, or irritation occurs, discontinue use.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="q">Are essential oils safe around pets?</div>
          <div class="a">Some oils can be irritating or toxic to animals. Always disclose pets when we consult. I prioritize pet-safe alternatives and diffusion practices that reduce exposure. Never force exposure on an animal.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="q">What about pregnancy, breastfeeding, or children?</div>
          <div class="a">Certain oils and dilutions are contraindicated in pregnancy and for infants/young children. If pregnant, breastfeeding, or working with children, please mention this when you contact me so we can prioritize safe choices. This is precautionary, not medical advice.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="q">Do you make custom blends?</div>
          <div class="a">Yes. Custom blends are offered within membership tiers and as one-off purchases. Customization always begins with safety screening for medications, sensitivities, and other considerations.</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:28px">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Final note & call to action</h3>
          <p class="small">If you’re ready to explore a calm ritual and thoughtful scent design, I’d love to meet you. Members receive priority booking and seasonal blends. Mention <strong>{{FAVORITE_BLEND}}</strong> if you have a preferred aroma — it helps me get to know your ear for scent.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px">
            <button class="btn" onclick="location.href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <a class="ghost" href="/pricing.html">See plans</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="small">&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div class="small">Created with care by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    function handleSubmit(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const f = e.target;
      const data = new FormData(f);
      // lightweight client-side validation for pets/pregnancy flags in message
      fetch('/.netlify/functions/contact', {method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(data)),headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'}})
        .then(r=>{
          if(r.ok){
            alert('Thanks — your message was sent. I will reply within 48 hours.');
            f.reset();
          } else {
            alert('Sorry — there was an issue sending your message. Please email ' + '{{EMAIL}}');
          }
        }).catch(()=> alert('Network error — please email ' + '{{EMAIL}}'));
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk: contact page for aromatherapy membership site (slug: aromatherapy-2026-02-16T17-00-15-270Z-025)\n\nFiles included in this bundle (chunk 4):\n- contact.html — full contact page with hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing snapshot, FAQ, and CTA.\n- README.md — this file.\n\nPurpose and notes:\n- Voice: warm_storyteller, membership-focused.\n- Safety-forward: FAQ and content emphasize dilution guidance, patch testing, pet and pregnancy precautions. No medical claims are made.\n- Placeholders used: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}. Replace them at deployment time.\n- Navigation labels vary from other pages: this file uses labels such as "Offerings" and "Connect" to keep subtle variation. Ensure links match your pages list (/services.html, /blends.html, /shop.html, /pricing.html, /about.html, /book.html, /contact.html).\n- Visual richness is provided via CSS and an inline decorative SVG pattern (no external images or CDN usage).\n- The contact form posts to a placeholder endpoint (/.netlify/functions/contact). Replace with your server endpoint or form processor. The client code is minimal and intended as a scaffold.\n\nAccessibility & responsive behavior:\n- Semantic headings and form labels included. Layout collapses to single-column for narrow viewports.\n\nIntegration tips:\n- Provide your own privacy policy link where noted and replace the demo endpoint with a secure backend.\n- If you maintain a separate assets/img/pattern.svg, you can adapt the inline SVG in contact.html to reference that file instead.\n- Membership pricing shown is illustrative. Adjust numbers and benefits in pricing.html (other chunk) to reflect your model.\n\nDeveloper notes:\n- No external fonts used. If you add fonts, host them locally.\n- The page avoids medical language and sticks to supportive language appropriate for aromatherapy practice.\n\nIf you need an alternate contact layout (map embed, two-step intake, or calendar integration), tell me which provider you use and I will produce an updated version."}
BUNDLE_END
